---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  activePage="about"
  title="About — João Jacinto"
  description="I design products that make things genuinely easier for the people who use them. Senior Product Designer based in Aveiro, Portugal."
>

  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="marquee about-marquee">
      <div class="marquee-track">
        <span>ABOUT ME</span><span>·</span><span>SOBRE MIM</span><span>·</span>
        <span>ABOUT ME</span><span>·</span><span>SOBRE MIM</span><span>·</span>
        <span>ABOUT ME</span><span>·</span><span>SOBRE MIM</span><span>·</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">

      <section class="why-grid reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">What is my 'why'?</span>
          <h2>I design products that make things genuinely easier for the people who use them.</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>I believe that every product designer should step into the shoes of their users, and learn from them day in and day out, to truly understand and meet their needs. By doing so, we can empower businesses to create products that genuinely resonate with their audience.</p>
          <p>My enthusiasm is fueled by a strong connection to the product and its people, an in-depth immersion in its development, and a continuous learning journey from user feedback and interactions.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="about-me">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">About me</span>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-col reveal reveal-d1">
            <h3>I'm…</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="https://www.enneagraminstitute.com/type-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">An Enneagram type 5</a></li>
              <li>An <a href="https://www.16personalities.com/intj-personality" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">INTJ-A</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-col reveal reveal-d2">
            <h3>Values</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Awareness</li>
              <li>Creativity</li>
              <li>Precision</li>
              <li>Respect</li>
              <li>Gratitude</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-col reveal reveal-d3">
            <h3>Passions</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Product Design</li>
              <li>Music production, drums</li>
              <li>VR</li>
              <li>Gaming</li>
              <li>Football</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="journey">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">My journey</span>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2024–now</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <span class="journey-co">@ Anchorage Digital</span>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Crypto/web3 infrastructure. Designing complex financial interfaces for institutional investors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2021–2024</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <span class="journey-co">@ StreamYard</span>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Live streaming platform. Led webinar UX, research ops, and the company-wide design system.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2019–2020</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <span class="journey-co">@ Talkdesk</span>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Worked on the AI trainer to improve model training workflows for CX agents.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2017–2019</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Product Designer</span>
              <span class="journey-co">@ Namecheap</span>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Domain & hosting. Built the support chat platform from zero to 200+ agents.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2015–2017</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">UX/UI Designer</span>
              <span class="journey-co">@ Be.Ubi</span>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">First role. GIS and 3D visualisation tools for engineering teams.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="tools reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Tools I use</span>
        <div class="tools-row">
          <span class="tool-tag">Figma</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Framer</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Notion</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Jira</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Linear</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">GitHub</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Maze</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Dovetail</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="about-cta reveal">
        <h2>Want to work together?</h2>
        <p>I'm always open to interesting projects and conversations.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/contact">
          <span class="btn-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 4h12v9H2z"/><path d="M2 4l6 5 6-5"/></svg></span>
          <span>Let's chat</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</Base>
